  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs the operator, I want to keep refining the modern composer (the compact card docked on the keyboard) as an **experimental option**, so that it improves without replacing the legacy full-screen composer, which stays the default for M4. (Operator, 2026-11-14.)\n\n### Where it lives\n\n- Behind `ExperimentalFeature.modernComposer` (Réglages › Expérimental › « Composer moderne »), set up by #903.\n- Code: `App/SwiftHFR/Experimental/ModernComposer/` (moved there by #903). Each place it replaces the legacy composer carries `// EXPERIMENTAL(modernComposer, #904)`.\n- Default **off** once #855 delivers the legacy full-screen path (until then, #903 keeps it on).\n\n### Work under this option\n\n- #853: the page above the open composer scrolls (composer docked as a bar on the keyboard). Its device check is still pending.\n- #895: less empty space around the bar and the card; one icon size (the card tools' size); icons in pills to try. The Claude iOS app is the reference.\n- #888 (merged): controls inside the card, small floating buttons with 44 pt hit areas.\n\nAny new refinement goes into this option. It never changes the legacy path (#855).\n\n### Rules\n\n- Claimed by the operator (`human/francoisgn`). mac/M1 or a child works on it only on the operator's go, and only inside the option's folder and markers.\n- M5. The option is refined continuously and can become the default only on an operator decision, recorded here.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] With the switch off, no code path of this folder runs (a test).\n- [ ] With the switch on, #853 and #895 behave as specified, and #888's hosted tests pass.\n\n- #909: the smiley picker closes on the first tap and collapses the floating composer. Fix it in `Experimental/ModernComposer/` after #903 (operator feedback, 2026-11-15).\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
